  "contracts": [
    "Every new object uses the actual CRuntimeClass.pfnCreateObject, bound to original factory entry before claim.",
    "Direct original Serialize store/load follows the original CMemFile+CArchive ownership sequence; no CDrawObj-specific identity/global-clone flag is set for CAni objects.",
    "Only private owned known scalar/string/array members may be prepared. All explicit expected native values must match before replacing the project list.",
    "Canonical whole-list replacement destroys old objects once, nulls their owning slots, then calls original CObArray.SetSize(0) and Add to adopt each independent new object.",
    "Unknown native lifecycle stops without guessed destructor, rollback or replay. Original owner setter18 establishes the actual owning CDrawObj before any private typed property setter."
  ]
